<title>USA: Hempstead, N.Y., $23 mln notes won by three firms.</title>
<headline>Hempstead, N.Y., $23 mln notes won by three firms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three firms won Hempstead, N.Y.'s $22.781 million bond anticipation note issue Thursday:</p>
<p>--Fleet Securities, $10 million. Net interest cost 3.7960 percent, 4.25 percent coupon.</p>
<p>--First Albany Corp, $6.781 million. NIC 3.8080 percent, 4.25 percent coupon.</p>
<p>--State Bank of Long Island, $6 million. NIC 3.74 percent, 4.10 percent coupon.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
